  - A hyphen or apostrophe at the start or end of a word is dropped.
  - Letters and digits together form one word, so [38;5;153mabc123[39m is 1 word.

  This also covers the two minor gaps deferred from Task 1.

  A subagent is now adding about five test assertions and no source changes. It will also check that each new test fails
  against at least one of the wrong patterns. When it finishes, I'll re-run the tests myself and have the change
  reviewed once. Then I'll delete the scratch workspace and finish the branch.

